{"id": "11db3ba7-c962-459e-99ed-b2bc04c1fcda", "slug": "nexus-universal-platform", "title": "Nexus - Universal Platform", "description": "Universal Platform Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus - Universal Platform\"\ndescription: \"Universal Platform Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#0F0F11\"\n  accent: \"#10B981\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#646464\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#646464\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus - Universal Platform\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 2; favorites: 3; remixes: 2.\nTags: login, css, auth, security, interactive.\n## Overview\nUniversal Platform Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nNexus Platform Solutions Network Resources Contact Sales Login Unified System Architecture Sync every system, empower every team. Flawlessly route data , execute workflows , and align objectives across your entire infra…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Sync every system, empower every team..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #0F0F11, accent #10B981, background #050505, surface #646464, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus - Universal Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden font-sans antialiased selection:bg-emerald-500/30 selection:text-emerald-200\">\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"w-full border-b border-white/5 bg-[#050505]/80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-500 to-emerald-300 flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:programming-linear\" class=\"text-white\" width=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight\">Nexus</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Links (Desktop) -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Network</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Resources</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Actions -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden sm:block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-300 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Contact Sales</a>\n                <button class=\"text-sm font-medium bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-all text-white\">\n                    Login\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Section -->\n    <main class=\"relative pt-24 pb-16 px-6 overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Top Badge -->\n        <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 mb-8 cursor-default hover:bg-neutral-800/80 transition-colors\">\n            <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.8);\"></span>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-neutral-300\">Unified System Architecture</span>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-400 ml-1\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Headlines -->\n        <div class=\"max-w-4xl text-center z-10\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-neutral-400 mb-6\" style=\"line-height: 1.1;\">\n                Sync every system,<br>empower every team.\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-base md:text-xl text-neutral-400 font-medium max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">\n                Flawlessly <span class=\"text-white inline-flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"text-orange-400\"></iconify-icon> route data</span>,\n                <span class=\"text-white inline-flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"text-blue-500\"></iconify-icon> execute workflows</span>, and\n                <span class=\"text-white inline-flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-two-rounded-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"text-fuchsia-400\"></iconify-icon> align objectives</span>\n                across your entire infrastructure—unified in one interface.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Complex Graphic Area -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1000px] h-[500px] md:h-[600px] mt-16 md:mt-24 mb-16 flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n            <!-- Background Canvas for Particles/Network Effect -->\n            <canvas id=\"networkCanvas\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Background subtle glow -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-500/5 blur-[120px] rounded-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Center Hub -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-20 w-32 h-32 md:w-40 md:h-40 rounded-[2rem] bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-neutral-800 shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center floating-element\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15), inset 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.02);\">\n                <!-- Inner shape representing integration -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-16 h-16\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-400 to-emerald-600\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tl from-white/90 to-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/20\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Satellite Nodes -->\n            <!-- Top Left -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[15%] left-[10%] md:left-[20%] z-10 floating-element\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.2s;\">\n                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0f0f11] border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-400 shadow-lg relative group cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:text-white\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cloud-storage-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Left -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[20%] left-[5%] md:left-[15%] z-10 floating-element\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.5s;\">\n                <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#0f0f11] border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-400 shadow-lg relative group cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:text-white\">\n                     <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-2xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-square-linear\" width=\"28\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Mid Left Inner -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[60%] left-[25%] md:left-[32%] z-10 floating-element\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.8s;\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#0f0f11] border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-400 shadow-lg relative group cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:text-white\">\n                     <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-lg opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Top Right -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[25%] right-[10%] md:right-[22%] z-10 floating-element\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.3s;\">\n                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0f0f11] border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-400 shadow-lg relative group cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:text-white\">\n                     <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Mid Right Inner -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[55%] right-[20%] md:right-[28%] z-10 floating-element\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.6s;\">\n                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0f0f11] border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-400 shadow-lg relative group cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:text-white\">\n                     <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-5-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Right -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[15%] right-[5%] md:right-[15%] z-10 floating-element\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.9s;\">\n                <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#0f0f11] border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-400 shadow-lg relative group cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:text-white\">\n                     <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-2xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"28\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Decorative static lines behind nodes (Canvas handles dynamic ones) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 hidden md:block\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 40%, #050505 80%);\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Call to Action Buttons -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 z-20\">\n            <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white text-[#050505] font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\">\n                Start Building Free\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-transparent border border-neutral-700 text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group\">\n                Explore Platform\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- JavaScript for Canvas Network Background & Floating Elements -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // --- 1. Floating Animation Logic ---\n            const floatingElements = document.querySelectorAll('.floating-element');\n            let startTime = null;\n\n            function floatAnimation(timestamp) {\n                if (!startTime) startTime = timestamp;\n                const progress = timestamp - startTime;\n\n                floatingElements.forEach((el, index) => {\n                    // Create varying float speeds and directions based on index\n                    const speed = 0.001 + (index * 0.0002);\n                    const amplitude = 10 + (index % 3) * 5;\n                    const yPos = Math.sin(progress * speed + (index * 100)) * amplitude;\n\n                    // Keep existing transforms if needed, but here we just apply Y translation\n                    el.style.transform = `translateY(${yPos}px)`;\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(floatAnimation);\n            }\n            requestAnimationFrame(floatAnimation);\n\n            // --- 2. Canvas Network Animation ---\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('networkCanvas');\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let particlesArray = [];\n            const numberOfParticles = 40; // Adjust for density\n            const connectionDistance = 150;\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            function resizeCanvas() {\n                const parent = canvas.parentElement;\n                canvas.width = parent.clientWidth;\n                canvas.height = parent.clientHeight;\n                initParticles();\n            }\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);\n\n            // Particle Class\n            class Particle {\n                constructor(x, y, speedX, speedY, size, color) {\n                    this.x = x;\n                    this.y = y;\n                    this.speedX = speedX;\n                    this.speedY = speedY;\n                    this.size = size;\n                    this.color = color;\n                    // Add a property to determine if it should gravitate towards center\n                    this.toCenter = Math.random() > 0.5;\n                }\n\n                update() {\n                    const centerX = canvas.width / 2;\n                    const centerY = canvas.height / 2;\n\n                    // Slight gravity towards center for some particles\n                    if (this.toCenter) {\n                        const dx = centerX - this.x;\n                        const dy = centerY - this.y;\n                        this.x += dx * 0.0005;\n                        this.y += dy * 0.0005;\n                    }\n\n                    this.x += this.speedX;\n                    this.y += this.speedY;\n\n                    // Bounce off edges smoothly\n                    if (this.x > canvas.width || this.x < 0) this.speedX = -this.speedX;\n                    if (this.y > canvas.height || this.y < 0) this.speedY = -this.speedY;\n                }\n\n                draw() {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fillStyle = this.color;\n                    ctx.fill();\n\n                    // Add glow to particles\n                    ctx.shadowBlur = 10;\n                    ctx.shadowColor = this.color;\n                }\n            }\n\n            function initParticles() {\n                particlesArray = [];\n                for (let i = 0; i < numberOfParticles; i++) {\n                    const size = Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5;\n                    const x = Math.random() * canvas.width;\n                    const y = Math.random() * canvas.height;\n                    const speedX = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3;\n                    const speedY = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3;\n                    // Mix of subtle white and emerald dots\n                    const isEmerald = Math.random() > 0.7;\n                    const color = isEmerald ? 'rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.6)' : 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)';\n\n                    particlesArray.push(new Particle(x, y, speedX, speedY, size, color));\n                }\n            }\n\n            function connectParticles() {\n                const centerX = canvas.width / 2;\n                const centerY = canvas.height / 2;\n\n                for (let a = 0; a < particlesArray.length; a++) {\n                    for (let b = a; b < particlesArray.length; b++) {\n                        const dx = particlesArray[a].x - particlesArray[b].x;\n                        const dy = particlesArray[a].y - particlesArray[b].y;\n                        const distance = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                        if (distance < connectionDistance) {\n                            // Calculate opacity based on distance\n                            const opacity = 1 - (distance / connectionDistance);\n\n                            // Check if connection is near center to make it glow green\n                            const distToCenterA = Math.sqrt(Math.pow(particlesArray[a].x - centerX, 2) + Math.pow(particlesArray[a].y - centerY, 2));\n                            const distToCenterB = Math.sqrt(Math.pow(particlesArray[b].x - centerX, 2) + Math.pow(particlesArray[b].y - centerY, 2));\n\n                            let strokeStyle = `rgba(100, 100, 100, ${opacity * 0.15})`; // Default dim line\n\n                            // If close to center, make lines green and brighter\n                            if (distToCenterA < 200 || distToCenterB < 200) {\n                                strokeStyle = `rgba(16, 185, 129, ${opacity * 0.3})`;\n                            }\n\n                            ctx.strokeStyle = strokeStyle;\n                            ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n                            ctx.shadowBlur = 0; // Prevent massive performance drop on lines\n                            ctx.beginPath();\n                            ctx.moveTo(particlesArray[a].x, particlesArray[a].y);\n                            ctx.lineTo(particlesArray[b].x, particlesArray[b].y);\n                            ctx.stroke();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            function animateCanvas() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n\n                // Draw background connections (simulating circuit board traces towards center)\n                const centerX = canvas.width / 2;\n                const centerY = canvas.height / 2;\n\n                // Static subtle grid/crosshair behind\n                ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.02)';\n                ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(centerX, 0);\n                ctx.lineTo(centerX, canvas.height);\n                ctx.moveTo(0, centerY);\n                ctx.lineTo(canvas.width, centerY);\n                ctx.stroke();\n\n                for (let i = 0; i < particlesArray.length; i++) {\n                    particlesArray[i].update();\n                    particlesArray[i].draw();\n                }\n                connectParticles();\n            }\n\n            // Initial setup\n            resizeCanvas();\n            animateCanvas();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-universal-platform.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-universal-platform.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-universal-platform-DESIGN.md", "views": 83, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T08:09:36.459492+00:00"}